# Rounding past BIGINT is an error, as in DuckDB 2.0 ("Overflow in ROUND
# of integer"). The pinned DuckDB 1.5.6 wraps instead (it answers
# -9223372036854775800 here), a wrong answer db-core does not copy.
statement error
SELECT round(id * 9223372036854775807, -1) FROM typed_nulls WHERE id = 1

# ---- decimal literals keep the scale they are written with ----

